        "name": "USN-8253-2",
        "description": "USN-8253-1 fixed a vulnerability in Postfix. This update provides the corresponding fix for Postfix on Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, Ubuntu 16.04 LTS, Ubuntu 18.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 20.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   Kamil Frankowicz discovered that Postfix incorrectly handled certain  enhanced status codes. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to  cause Postfix to crash, resulting in a denial of service.",
